,\n      \"text\": \"Yes, there are several interior design services available for different spaces and project needs. You can explore the options to find suitable services for your requirements.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script>\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/bbb4.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 68px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n        .hero-section p {\n            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 26px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us (Checklist) --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;\n            font-size: 1.05em;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            max-width: 1100px;\n            margin: 0 auto 40px auto;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list li strong {\n            display: block;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding-top: 30px;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            padding: 40px 0 20px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 36px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            padding: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 12px 36px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        /* Work Gallery Carousel */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        .gallery-card-content {\n            padding: 22px 20px;\n            flex-grow: 1;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n        .gallery-card-content h3 {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.3;\n        }\n        .gallery-card-content p {\n            font-size: 14px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n                /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n\n    \n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Interior Design Services in Noida</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            \n            <h2>Interior Design That Fits the Way You Live and Work</h2>\n            <p>A good interior is more than a beautiful room. It should feel comfortable, support daily activities and use space well. Our Top <b>Interior Design Services in Noida</b>&nbsp;are planned for residential, commercial, and luxury spaces, with attention to practical needs. Every project starts by understanding the space, purpose, and client&rsquo;s ideas.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Tailored Design Solutions by Experienced Interior Designers for Every Space</h2>\n            <p>Different spaces need different design ideas. A home should feel warm, easy to use, and personal. An office should support work, movement, meetings, and storage. Commercial spaces need layouts that support easy movement and a strong visual impression. Our <b>interior designers in Noida</b> consider these needs before developing the design.</p>\n            <p>Our interior design services start with comprehending customer habits, business requirements and expectations to tailor the design, ensuring that it matches rather than employing a similar style in each of the projects. A balance of creativity and usability must be achieved to enable the end place to function efficiently each day.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICES GRID -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>From Space Planning to Final Details</h3>\n                <p>Another key element is <b>interior designing</b>, where the furniture, work areas, storage units, lighting, and different objects are put into place. Interior designing allows for efficiency, smooth workflow, and utilization of the smallest areas.</p><p>In <b>residential interior designing in Noida</b>, we plan out each living space as per your style and the individuals living in your house. Living room, Bedroom, Dining, kitchen, and all other living spaces are planned on the basis of utility and purpose. We plan in coordination with all your needs, including the furniture, materials to be used, lighting schemes, color palettes, and storage elements to make your house appear cohesive.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Designs Created Around Your Needs</h3>\n                <p>Since each project will undoubtedly have its own particular needs, a tailored design to an <b>apartment/house interiors in Noida</b>&nbsp;is one that would be best! We work by no set design; instead, the design will accommodate the specific size and functions of the apartment and the client, along with the specific wishes.</p><p>Within our interior design services, material selection is handled with care. Different areas may need different surfaces, finishes, furniture materials, and lighting solutions. These choices affect look, comfort, maintenance, and use. Planning them at the right stage helps create a balanced result.</p><p>3D visualization and detailed space planning help clients understand the proposed design before execution. This makes it easier to see the layout, discuss changes, and decide clearly.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Complete Support From Start to Finish</h3>\n                <p>A smooth project needs proper coordination at every stage. Our interior design services in Noida provide end-to-end design and execution so the work can move from the first idea toward completion in an organized way. Project management keeps design and execution tasks connected.</p><p>Detail throughout must be applied, furniture selection, light fittings, textures, and finishes are assessed as part of the whole rather than standalone options. It means that interiors are both beautiful and work perfectly.</p><p>People searching for an <b>interior design company in Noida</b>&nbsp;often want creative ideas along with dependable project support. A professional design team can bring requirements together from planning to final details.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Why the Right Design Approach Matters</h3>\n                <p>The right interior can improve how people experience a property every day. Good planning can make movement easier, storage more useful, lighting more suitable, and the overall space more comfortable. The design should also reflect the client&rsquo;s taste or business identity.</p><p><b>Interior Design Services in Noida</b>&nbsp;also helps avoid problems caused by poor planning. A clear layout, suitable materials, and planned lighting can make the space more useful and connected.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <!-- FAQS -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What spaces can be designed?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Our interior design services cover residential, commercial, and luxury spaces. The design is planned according to the purpose, size, and requirements of each property.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you provide complete design and execution?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. The service covers the process from concept and planning to execution, helping keep the project organized from beginning to completion.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can the design be customized?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Designs can be customized according to lifestyle, brand requirements, space conditions, preferences, and the intended use of the property.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you use 3D visualization?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. 3D visualization helps clients understand the proposed concept and space arrangement before the execution stage.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Are there more interior design services available?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes, there are several <b>interior design services</b>&nbsp;available fo